{"ticker":"KHC","updated":"2026-11-07T00:25:36Z","profile":{"longName":"The Kraft Heinz Company","shortName":"The Kraft Heinz Company","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"United States","website":"https://www.kraftheinzcompany.com","fullTimeEmployees":35000,"marketCap":29134032896,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":11.893658,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.1758025,"pegRatio":0.99,"targetMeanPrice":24.69444,"targetHighPrice":41.0,"targetLowPrice":19.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.02,"earningsGrowth":-0.117,"grossMargins":0.33651,"operatingMargins":0.16468,"profitMargins":-0.13992,"totalRevenue":24778000384,"beta":0.103,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":28.09,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":21.035,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":6.32},"summary":"The Kraft Heinz Company, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and markets food and beverage products in North America and internationally. Its products include condiments, sauces, dressings, and spreads; cheese, frozen potato products, and other frozen meals; meal kits, frozen snacks, and pickles; dry packaged desserts, refrigerated ready to eat desserts, and other dessert toppings; ready to drink and powdered beverages, and liquid concentrates; American sliced and recipe cheeses; mainstream coffee, coffee pods, and premium coffee; and cold cuts, bacon, and hot dogs. It offers its products under the Kraft, Oscar Mayer, Heinz, Philadelphia, Lunchables, Velveeta, Ore-Ida, Capri Sun, Maxwell House, Kool-Aid, Jell-O, ABC, Master, Quero, Golden Circle, Wattie's, Pudliszki, and Plasmon brands, as well as Bagel Bites, Claussen, A1, and Cool Whip. It sells its products through its own sales organizations, as well as through independent brokers, agents, and distributors to chain, wholesale, cooperative, and independent grocery accounts; convenience, value, and club stores; pharmacies and drug stores; mass merchants; foodservice distributors; institutions, including hotels, restaurants, bakeries, hospitals, health care facilities, and government agencies; and various e-commerce platforms and retailers. The company has a strategic partnership with the National Football League. The","summary_zh":"卡夫亨氏及其子公司在北美和國際上生產和銷售食品和飲料產品。其產品包括調味品、醬汁、調味料和塗抹醬；起司、冷凍馬鈴薯製品和其他冷凍食品；餐包、冷凍零食和泡菜；乾包裝甜點、冷藏即食甜點以及其他甜點配料；即飲和粉狀飲料以及液體濃縮物；美式切片起司和配方起司；主流咖啡、咖啡包、精品咖啡；還有冷盤、培根和熱狗。該公司提供的產品有 Kraft、Oscar Mayer、Heinz、Philadelphia、Lunchables、Velveeta、Ore-Ida、Capri Sun、Maxwell House、Kool-Aid、Jell-O、ABC、Master、Quero、Golden Circle、Wattie's、Pudliszki 和 Pell-O、ABC、Master、Quero、Golden Circle、Wattie's、Pudliszki 和 Plasmon 品牌，以及 Bagel B1、Cssenel B。它透過自己的銷售組織以及透過獨立經紀人、代理商和分銷商向連鎖、批發、合作和獨立雜貨帳戶銷售其產品；便利商店、超值店和俱樂部商店；藥房和藥店；大眾商家；餐飲服務經銷商；機構，包括酒店、餐廳、麵包店、醫院、醫療保健機構和政府機構；以及各種電子商務平台和零售商。公司與國家美式足球聯盟建立策略夥伴關係。這","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"包裝食品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":27.14,"h":27.15,"l":26.53,"c":26.9,"v":17984200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":26.79,"h":27.0,"l":26.66,"c":26.67,"v":8218900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":26.61,"h":26.73,"l":26.332,"c":26.65,"v":13538200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":26.7,"h":26.94,"l":26.5,"c":26.52,"v":10763400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":26.57,"h":26.57,"l":26.045,"c":26.13,"v":17152300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":26.23,"h":26.37,"l":25.62,"c":25.63,"v":23134600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":25.63,"h":26.05,"l":25.61,"c":25.93,"v":18271400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":25.92,"h":26.25,"l":25.67,"c":25.73,"v":13239200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":25.73,"h":26.22,"l":25.66,"c":26.08,"v":21000700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":26.235,"h":26.56,"l":26.17,"c":26.42,"v":33012500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":26.38,"h":26.52,"l":26.26,"c":26.38,"v":14522400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":26.45,"h":26.69,"l":26.43,"c":26.56,"v":14222000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":26.48,"h":26.85,"l":26.43,"c":26.74,"v":13109500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":26.89,"h":26.89,"l":25.77,"c":25.81,"v":13950900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":25.83,"h":26.15,"l":25.82,"c":26.05,"v":15286100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":26.065,"h":26.069,"l":25.352,"c"